{"logId": "35be3e2d-fa1b-44a5-a808-f76e054809e1", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "“小红鱼”的故事", "block_bbox": [239, 225, 638, 283], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 225.0], [638.0, 225.0], [638.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：新乡广场/丁燕", "block_bbox": [478, 292, 638, 316], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[478.0, 292.0], [638.0, 292.0], [638.0, 316.0], [478.0, 316.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "那天早上刚迎完宾，一位老大娘手提着一棵包菜和一块豆腐步履蹒跚地走向了我的款台。我急忙弯腰接住了她的东西，扫完价后说：“大娘，您好！一共两块四毛。”她边说“好”边往口袋里掏钱。只见她颤巍巍地从怀里掏出了一个纸包，里面有几张皱巴巴的一块和一张“小红鱼”一百。我心里祈祷着她给我一块的，别给我那个“小红鱼”，因为我现在零钱很少。", "block_bbox": [277, 371, 1015, 432], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[277.0, 371.0], [1015.0, 371.0], [1015.0, 432.0], [277.0, 432.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [488, 440, 1018, 574], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[488.0, 440.0], [1018.0, 440.0], [1018.0, 574.0], [488.0, 574.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [73, 603, 225, 727], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[73.0, 603.0], [225.0, 603.0], [225.0, 727.0], [73.0, 727.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [270, 420, 492, 672], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[270.0, 420.0], [492.0, 420.0], [492.0, 672.0], [270.0, 672.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“闺女，给你一百！”只见她用手展了几次那张“小红鱼”才递给我。", "block_bbox": [492, 580, 1016, 642], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[492.0, 580.0], [1016.0, 580.0], [1016.0, 642.0], [492.0, 642.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“大娘，您有零钱吗？”我轻声问。", "block_bbox": [514, 650, 808, 677], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[514.0, 650.0], [808.0, 650.0], [808.0, 677.0], [514.0, 677.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "她窘迫地看了看我，欲收回她的一百元，嘴里喃喃地说：“闺女，这一百元我在哪儿都不敢花，怕找给我假钱，只有在这儿我才放心啊！”听到这话，我突然鼻子一酸，天哪，我差点犯了个大错！于是我什么也没说，快速地找给了她一把崭新的零钱，大娘一个劲地谢我，但我觉得很惭愧。\n通过这件事，我觉得自己所肩负的责任不小，每一个胖东来人都代表我们的公司，老百姓这么信任我们，我们更要加倍地努力，让他们失望。", "block_bbox": [238, 685, 1015, 747], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 685.0], [1015.0, 685.0], [1015.0, 747.0], [238.0, 747.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [238, 754, 567, 956], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 754.0], [567.0, 754.0], [567.0, 956.0], [238.0, 956.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [238, 964, 462, 1201], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 964.0], [462.0, 964.0], [462.0, 1201.0], [238.0, 1201.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [540, 758, 1005, 1261], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[540.0, 758.0], [1005.0, 758.0], [1005.0, 1261.0], [540.0, 1261.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "从批评关空调说起", "block_bbox": [111, 1406, 402, 1449], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1406.0], [402.0, 1406.0], [402.0, 1449.0], [111.0, 1449.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.833644926548